OL,3,GNEWSARam sales go ahead despite
OL,4,Abluetongue disease restrictions nearby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe biggest single-day ram sale in
OL,7,FEurope is set to take place in the
OL,8,FScottish Borders despite disease
OL,9,Frestrictions imposed on much of
OL,10,Fneighbouring Dumfries and Galloway
OL,11,Fafter cases of bluetongue were
OL,12,Fdetected.
OL,14,FMore than 4,300 rams across 17 breeds
OL,15,Fwill go under the hammer in Kelso with
OL,16,Fmore than #5m expected to change hands.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
