OL,3,GNEWSARam sales go ahead despite
OL,4,Abluetongue disease restrictions nearby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new restricted zone came into force
OL,7,Fin south-west Scotland on Thursday
OL,8,Fmeaning livestock such as cattle, sheep
OL,9,Fand other susceptible ruminants will
OL,10,Fstill need a licence if they are being
OL,11,Fmoved to the rest of Scotland.
OL,13,FThe Border Union Agricultural Society
OL,14,Fsaid it was creating logistical
OL,15,Fchallenges for some breeders but strong
OL,16,Fentries - up 9% on last year - meant it
OL,17,Fwould still be a major day for sheep
OL,18,Ffarming.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
